    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_maggots",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_Maggots_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A writhing handful of fly maggots picked from rotting remains. Laid on an infected open wound they eat away the rot and leave the wound cleaner."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_maggots",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_Maggots_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Found:</b> Collect Maggots on Rotten Remains, outside winter.\n\n<b>Uses:</b> Drag them onto an open wound (a bite, claw marks, a laceration or a burn) that has any infection with <b>Apply Maggots</b>: the wound's Infection falls by 180, more than a wash with water or bog myrtle tea and less than soap. It is unpleasant: your Stress rises by 15. The maggots are used up.\n\n<b>Keeping:</b> They crawl away within a day."
    },
